  "notes": [
    "Settled recipe (2026-11-17): 24 steps, handheld-camera wording, then a 1.5x lanczos upscale with a light sharpen.",
    "Audio: high-pass at 70 Hz, a noise gate, a gentle compressor, then loudness to -15. The clip opens with about 1.2 seconds of very quiet room noise, so the gate must come before any loudness step.",
    "Swap (2026-11-17): the model makes only a donor clip, 56 frames at 24 fps per call (about 2.33 s), guided by the original footage; the composite step keeps every original pixel outside the head. The numbers the swap reads are listed in recipes/swap.md after the measured line."
  ]
